# Resources bundled inside the RTP jar, one resource name per line.
# AddonRegistry#extractBundledAddons copies each listed resource from the
# classpath resource bundled-addons/<name> into <pluginDir>/addons/ on
# first run (when the addons/ folder does not yet exist), so the bundled
# addons work out of the box. This is mostly addon jars, plus README.md so
# operators get an explanation of the folder alongside them. Deleting an
# extracted jar while keeping the folder is a permanent opt-out for that
# addon; deleting the whole folder instead makes RTP re-extract everything
# on the next run. Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
LeafRTPGuiAddon.jar
LeafRTPClaimAddon.jar
LeafRTPCountdownAddon.jar
README.md
